text Naranja_IslaNueva_G15_M07_Text_0818FB36 {
    "You’re a POKéMON TRAINER, aren’t you?\pSOOTOPOLIS’s GYM LEADER WALLACE has\nmany fans.\lDo you have any?"
}

text Naranja_IslaNueva_G15_M07_Text_0818FB9C {
    "Oh, then you must be pretty strong."
}

text Naranja_IslaNueva_G15_M07_Text_0818FBC0 {
    "Oh, dear...\nThat’s a little lonesome.\pTry working a little harder to get a\nfan following."
}

text Naranja_IslaNueva_G15_M07_Text_0818FC1A {
    "Dedicated fans come over from even\nKANTO and JOHTO.\pIt was really wild when I went to the\nTRAINER FAN CLUB in LILYCOVE."
}
